---
// The Songhealth Homepage, / (Feature 003 #64, #65; spec #51 "Homepage (`04`, Figma order)", `04`;
// docs/design/homepage-concept-v1.md). A view of published content, in the Figma order:
//
// - the hero (Feature 008 #241; spec #239 "Hero and Featured"; HomeHero): the office summary as
//   the headline, the site search, a GET form to /search, and the Featured item as a card, the
//   first item of the Featured menu that resolves to published content
//   (src/lib/homepage-curation.ts). With none, the headline and the search alone;
// - the Frequently Used Services (Feature 008 #242; spec #239 "Frequently Used Services";
//   HomeServiceCard): up to 6 Services from their menu, in menu order, as white cards on the
//   hero's deep field (HomeDeepField), three to a row from `lg`, two from `sm` and one below. Four
//   Services go two to a row, so no cell is empty. From `sm` the grid's lower 110 px
//   (--field-overhang) lie below the field, which leaves that room under it. With no Service the
//   field ends under the hero;
// - the Leadership strip (Feature 008 #243; spec #239 "Leadership strip"; HomeLeadershipStrip): the
//   first three Leadership by Leadership order (src/lib/personnel-directory.ts), fewer when fewer
//   exist, in one white strip in the page colour, with a link to /about/leadership. It starts
//   below the Services' cards, after the room the field leaves, and takes its space below from
//   Latest News, or its own when Latest News is left out;
// - Latest News (Feature 008 #244; spec #239 "Latest News"; HomeNewsCard): the five newest
//   published News, the Featured one left out (`04` §7), the newest as a large card. With five,
//   the large card stands beside the other four two by two from `lg` and spans the row above them
//   from `sm`; below `sm` three compact rows follow it. With fewer, the grid has two columns from
//   `sm` and the large card spans the row when the others are an even number, so no cell is empty;
// - the Current Announcements (Feature 008 #245; spec #239 "Current Announcements";
//   HomeAnnouncementRow): the four newest current Announcements by announcement date, the Featured
//   one left out (`04` §7), three below `sm`, as rows with a date tile, the category, the title and
//   the status and dates the Announcements list shows (src/lib/announcements.ts). The section is a
//   surface-soft band with a white glow at its upper left corner, and from `lg` its heading, lead
//   and solid link to the list stay in view at the left, below the sticky header, while the rows
//   scroll (Product Owner, 2026-11-12: #245 comment 6812117246);
// - Health Information (Feature 008 #246; spec #239 "Health Information"; HomeHealthCard): a row
//   of chips, one for each Health Topic the Health Content list's filter offers
//   (src/lib/terms.ts offeredTerms), each a link to that list narrowed to the topic; then the
//   latest 4 Health Content items, each with its first Health Topic, the `topic` term EmDash
//   hydrates first, as a badge, four to a row from `lg`, two from `sm` and compact rows below;
// - Health Service Discovery (Feature 008 #246; spec #239 "Health Service Discovery"): a rounded
//   green band on the page's colour with the section heading, a lead, the number of published
//   Health Services and of the Areas the directory's filter offers, the second only when there is
//   one, and in a white card an Area select and a name field, a GET form to the Health Service
//   Directory with the directory's own parameters and labels
//   (src/lib/health-service-directory.ts; Product Owner, 2026-11-12: #246 comment 6816725778);
// - the latest Activities by when they were held (ADR 0004), 3 on a desktop and 4 on phones and
//   tablets;
// - Quick Access: up to 4 shortcuts from their menu, in menu order, each a label and an arrow;
// - the Contact Summary: the site title, then Office Contact's address with the "เปิดแผนที่" link,
//   main telephone and opening hours (OfficeContactDetails), each only when set, and a link to
//   /contact. A static visual stands in for the map; no map is embedded.
//
// Each section between the hero and the Contact Summary opens with the Homepage section heading
// (spec #239 "Section headings"; SectionHeading): an icon tile, a label and the H2. The Frequently
// Used Services, the Announcements, Health Information and Activities are named as their lists
// are, Latest News is "ข่าวประชาสัมพันธ์", and each of these headings links to the section's list.
// The sections of later tickets take the heading now, without a lead, so the page has one heading
// style (Product Owner, 2026-11-11: #241 comment 6791096480, item 4). The Current Announcements
// show their lead and their link beside the heading, and the Health Service Discovery band its
// lead under it.
//
// Health Information lies on the page's colour. It has its own space above only after a band: the
// Current Announcements, or the deep field when nothing else precedes it. Latest News and the
// Leadership strip leave their own space below otherwise. The discovery band takes that space
// above when Health Information is left out, and its own space below when no Activities follow.
//
// The hero's site search and the discovery form show their submit state (spec #239 "Motion and
// loading"; SubmitStateIcon): the page's one inline script, at its end, marks a submitted form,
// which then shows a spinner on its button and ignores a further submit, and takes the mark off
// when the page is shown again from history, as after the browser's back button.
//
// Below 640 px the page is shorter, with every section kept in its order (Feature 006 #146; spec
// #144 "Homepage (`04`)"; the Product Owner's "โอเค เฉพาะหน้าแรก" on the prototype): the
// Activities and Quick Access go two to a row in their compact cards; the Contact
// Summary's lead and the map's stand-in are left out; each section after the deep field has 32 px
// of space above and below it. The 4th
// Activity fills the second row of two; a desktop row holds three.
//
// A section with nothing to show is left out (`04` §17): the Frequently Used Services, Latest News,
// the Announcements, the Leadership strip, Health Information, Health Service Discovery while
// no Health Service is published, Activities and Quick Access. The hero and the Contact Summary
// always render, so the page answers with no content at all. The site title is the page's H1,
// hidden from sight in the hero, whose headline shows in its place (spec #239 "Hero and Featured").
//
// Beyond the Figma frame, on the Product Owner's decision (2026-10-30: #64 comment 6526131459):
// the links to the News, Announcements and Health Content lists, since the Announcements list is in
// no navigation (each in its section's heading); each Announcement's status; and the Contact
// Summary's lead as the page's description, since a tagline is a slogan and EmDash's site settings
// hold no description (emdash 1.1.0 src/api/schemas/settings.ts).
//
// The meta element named "songhealth-foundation" with content "public-runtime" is the Feature 001
// public-runtime marker (T011): tests/browser/foundation.spec.ts, the development runtime's verify
// script and container health check, and the T016/T022 production verification all read it from
// the server-rendered HTML of `/`. Keep it exactly as written.
import FileText from "@lucide/astro/icons/file-text";
import Heart from "@lucide/astro/icons/heart";
import HeartPulse from "@lucide/astro/icons/heart-pulse";
import Hospital from "@lucide/astro/icons/hospital";
import MessageSquare from "@lucide/astro/icons/message-square";
import Search from "@lucide/astro/icons/search";
import Users from "@lucide/astro/icons/users";
import ActivityCard from "../components/ActivityCard.astro";
import ArrowLink from "../components/ArrowLink.astro";
import HomeAnnouncementRow from "../components/HomeAnnouncementRow.astro";
import HomeDeepField from "../components/HomeDeepField.astro";
import HomeHealthCard from "../components/HomeHealthCard.astro";
import HomeHero from "../components/HomeHero.astro";
import HomeLeadershipStrip from "../components/HomeLeadershipStrip.astro";
import HomeNewsCard from "../components/HomeNewsCard.astro";
import HomeServiceCard from "../components/HomeServiceCard.astro";
import OfficeContactDetails from "../components/OfficeContactDetails.astro";
import QuickLinkCard from "../components/QuickLinkCard.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/SectionHeading.astro";
import SectionListLink from "../components/SectionListLink.astro";
import SubmitStateIcon from "../components/SubmitStateIcon.astro";
import ThaiTitle from "../components/ThaiTitle.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { ACTIVITIES_PATH, ACTIVITIES_TITLE, latestActivities } from "../lib/activities";
import {
	ANNOUNCEMENTS_PATH,
	ANNOUNCEMENTS_TITLE,
	currentAnnouncements,
} from "../lib/announcements";
import { HEALTH_CONTENT_PATH, HEALTH_CONTENT_TITLE } from "../lib/health";
import { healthContentListPath, latestHealthContent } from "../lib/health-content";
import { FILTER_LABELS, FILTER_PARAMS, directoryPath } from "../lib/health-service-directory";
import { directoryOverview } from "../lib/health-services";
import { readHomepageCuration } from "../lib/homepage-curation";
import { latestNews } from "../lib/news";
import { readOfficeContact } from "../lib/office-contact";
import { OFFICE_SUMMARY } from "../lib/office-summary";
import { listHomepageLeadership } from "../lib/personnel";
import { SERVICES_PATH, SERVICES_TITLE } from "../lib/service-catalog";
import { getSiteIdentity } from "../lib/site-identity";
import { offeredTerms } from "../lib/terms";

/** One instant for the current Announcements, the status each states and the Featured item's. */
const now = new Date();
const [
	identity,
	{ featured, services, quickAccess },
	leaders,
	newestNews,
	newestAnnouncements,
	healthContent,
	healthTopics,
	directory,
	activities,
	{ contact },
] = await Promise.all([
	getSiteIdentity(Astro.url),
	readHomepageCuration(Astro.url.origin, now),
	listHomepageLeadership(),
	latestNews(6),
	currentAnnouncements(5, now),
	latestHealthContent(4),
	offeredTerms("health_content", "topic"),
	directoryOverview(),
	latestActivities(4),
	readOfficeContact(),
]);
/**
 * Whether an entry of `collection` is other than the Featured item, which the page already shows.
 */
const notFeatured =
	(collection: string) =>
	({ data }: { data: { id: string } }) =>
		!(featured?.collection === collection && featured.id === data.id);
/** The Latest News: the five newest News that are not Featured. */
const news = newestNews.filter(notFeatured("news")).slice(0, 5);
/** The Current Announcements: the four newest current ones that are not Featured. */
const announcements = newestAnnouncements.filter(notFeatured("announcements")).slice(0, 4);
/**
 * Whether Latest News follows the Leadership strip on the page's own colour and gives the strip
 * its space below.
 */
const showsNews = news.length > 0;
/**
 * Whether the large News card spans the row from `sm`: when the small cards are an even number, so
 * the two columns leave no empty cell.
 */
const largeSpansRow = news.length % 2 === 1;
/** Whether the large News card stands beside the four small cards from `lg`. */
const largeBesideFour = news.length === 5;
/**
 * The large News card's least height: 300 px, 380 px from `sm` where it spans the row, and 520 px
 * from `lg` beside the four small cards.
 */
const largeCardHeight = [
	"min-h-75",
	largeSpansRow && "sm:min-h-95",
	largeBesideFour && "lg:min-h-130",
]
	.filter(Boolean)
	.join(" ");
/** The space below a section after the deep field, and the same above it. */
const spaceBelow = "pb-8 sm:pb-16 lg:pb-20";
const spaceAbove = "pt-8 sm:pt-16 lg:pt-20";

/**
 * Whether what follows on the page's colour comes after a band, and so takes its own space above:
 * after the Current Announcements, or after the deep field with neither the Leadership strip nor
 * Latest News between them.
 */
const followsBand = announcements.length > 0 || (!showsNews && leaders.length === 0);

/** The Health Service Discovery fields' box: 52 px high, with a 3:1 boundary, as FilterForm's. */
const control =
	"mb-2 h-13 w-full min-w-0 rounded-14 border-[1.5px] border-border-input bg-surface-base px-4 text-body";
---

<SiteLayout section="home" description={OFFICE_SUMMARY} canonical="/">
	<meta slot="head" name="songhealth-foundation" content="public-runtime" />

	<HomeDeepField extended={services.length > 0}>
		<HomeHero siteTitle={identity.title} featured={featured} />
		{services.length > 0 && (
			<section aria-labelledby="home-services" class="relative pt-2 max-sm:pb-10">
				<div class="page-container flex flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-7">
					<SectionHeading
						surface="field"
						id="home-services"
						label="บริการ"
						title={SERVICES_TITLE}
						href={SERVICES_PATH}
					>
						<Users slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
					</SectionHeading>
					<ul
						class:list={[
							"grid gap-3 sm:-mb-(--field-overhang) sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-5",
							services.length !== 4 && "lg:grid-cols-3",
						]}
					>
						{services.map((service) => (
							<li>
								<HomeServiceCard service={service} />
							</li>
						))}
					</ul>
				</div>
			</section>
		)}
	</HomeDeepField>

	{leaders.length > 0 && (
		<section
			aria-labelledby="home-leadership"
			class:list={["pt-8 sm:pt-10", !showsNews && spaceBelow]}
		>
			<div class="page-container">
				<HomeLeadershipStrip id="home-leadership" people={leaders} />
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	{showsNews && (
		<section aria-labelledby="home-news" class:list={[spaceAbove, spaceBelow]}>
			<div class="page-container flex flex-col gap-7">
				<SectionHeading id="home-news" label="ข่าวสาร" title="ข่าวประชาสัมพันธ์" href="/news">
					<MessageSquare slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
				</SectionHeading>
				<ul
					class:list={[
						"grid gap-3.5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6",
						largeBesideFour && "lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_1fr_1fr]",
					]}
				>
					{news.map((item, index) => (
						<li
							class:list={[
								"min-w-0",
								index === 0 && largeSpansRow && "sm:col-span-2",
								index === 0 && largeBesideFour && "lg:col-span-1 lg:row-span-2",
								index === 4 && "max-sm:hidden",
							]}
						>
							{index === 0 ? (
								<HomeNewsCard news={item} large class={largeCardHeight} />
							) : (
								<HomeNewsCard news={item} />
							)}
						</li>
					))}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	{announcements.length > 0 && (
		<section
			aria-labelledby="home-announcements"
			class:list={["relative overflow-clip bg-surface-soft", spaceAbove, spaceBelow]}
		>
			<span
				aria-hidden="true"
				class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-15 -left-40 h-120 w-130 rounded-pill bg-linear-140 from-surface-base to-transparent to-70%"
			/>
			<div class="page-container relative grid gap-6 sm:gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.6fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-14">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-x-4 lg:sticky lg:top-[calc(var(--header-offset)+1.5rem)] lg:block">
					<SectionHeading id="home-announcements" label="แจ้งให้ทราบ" title={ANNOUNCEMENTS_TITLE}>
						<FileText slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
					</SectionHeading>
					<p class="col-span-2 row-start-2 mt-3 text-body text-text-secondary-on-soft sm:text-body-large lg:mt-5">
						ข้อมูลที่อาจมีวันสิ้นสุดหรือการดำเนินการ
					</p>
					<SectionListLink
						href={ANNOUNCEMENTS_PATH}
						title={ANNOUNCEMENTS_TITLE}
						tone="solid"
						class="col-start-2 row-start-1 lg:mt-7"
					/>
				</div>
				<ul class="flex flex-col gap-3.5">
					{announcements.map((announcement, index) => (
						<li class:list={[index === 3 && "max-sm:hidden"]}>
							<HomeAnnouncementRow announcement={announcement} now={now} />
						</li>
					))}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	{healthContent.length > 0 && (
		<section aria-labelledby="home-health" class:list={[followsBand && spaceAbove, spaceBelow]}>
			<div class="page-container flex flex-col gap-4.5 sm:gap-7">
				<SectionHeading
					id="home-health"
					label="สุขภาพ"
					title={HEALTH_CONTENT_TITLE}
					href={HEALTH_CONTENT_PATH}
				>
					<HeartPulse slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
				</SectionHeading>
				{healthTopics.length > 0 && (
					<ul aria-label="ประเด็นสุขภาพ" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 sm:-mt-3 sm:gap-2.5">
						{healthTopics.map((topic) => (
							<li class="flex min-w-0">
								<a
									href={healthContentListPath(topic.slug)}
									class="rounded-pill border-[1.5px] border-border-default bg-surface-base px-3 py-1 text-small font-medium wrap-anywhere text-brand-primary hover:border-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-primary hover:text-surface-base motion-safe:transition-colors sm:px-4 sm:py-1.5 sm:text-label"
								>
									{topic.label}
								</a>
							</li>
						))}
					</ul>
				)}
				<ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6 lg:grid-cols-4">
					{healthContent.map((item) => (
						<li class="min-w-0">
							<HomeHealthCard item={item} />
						</li>
					))}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	{directory.count > 0 && (
		<section
			aria-labelledby="home-discovery"
			class:list={[
				healthContent.length === 0 && followsBand && spaceAbove,
				activities.length === 0 && spaceBelow,
			]}
		>
			<div class="page-container">
				<div
					data-testid="discovery-band"
					class="deep-band focus-ring-on-dark relative grid items-center gap-6 overflow-clip rounded-24 px-5 py-7 text-surface-base shadow-deep sm:gap-8 sm:rounded-32 sm:p-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] lg:gap-12 lg:p-14"
				>
					<span
						aria-hidden="true"
						class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-37.5 -right-22.5 size-85 rounded-pill border-[1.5px] border-accent-warm/45 max-lg:hidden"
					/>
					<div class="relative">
						<SectionHeading
							surface="field"
							id="home-discovery"
							label="หน่วยบริการ"
							title="หน่วยบริการสุขภาพในอำเภอสอง"
						>
							<Hospital slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
						</SectionHeading>
						<p class="mt-3 text-body sm:text-body-large lg:mt-5">
							เลือกตำบลหรือพิมพ์ชื่อ เพื่อดูข้อมูลติดต่อ เวลาเปิดบริการ และแผนที่
						</p>
						<ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-9 gap-y-2 sm:mt-6">
							<li class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5">
								<span class="text-h2 font-bold text-accent-warm sm:text-h1">{directory.count}</span>{" "}
								<span>หน่วยบริการ</span>
							</li>
							{directory.areas.length > 0 && (
								<li class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5">
									<span class="text-h2 font-bold text-accent-warm sm:text-h1">
										{directory.areas.length}
									</span>{" "}
									<span>พื้นที่</span>
								</li>
							)}
						</ul>
					</div>
					<form
						method="get"
						action={directoryPath()}
						aria-label="ค้นหาหน่วยบริการ"
						data-submit-state
						class="group/submit focus-ring-on-light relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-24 bg-surface-base p-5 text-text-primary shadow-deep sm:p-7"
					>
						<label class="text-label font-semibold" for="discovery-area">
							{FILTER_LABELS.area}
						</label>
						<select id="discovery-area" name={FILTER_PARAMS.area} class={control}>
							<option value="">{FILTER_LABELS.anyArea}</option>
							{directory.areas.map((area) => (
								<option value={area.slug}>{area.label}</option>
							))}
						</select>
						<label class="text-label font-semibold" for="discovery-name">
							{FILTER_LABELS.name}
						</label>
						<input id="discovery-name" name={FILTER_PARAMS.name} type="search" class={control} />
						<button
							type="submit"
							class="mt-1.5 inline-flex h-13 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-accent-warm px-7 text-body font-semibold text-brand-dark hover:shadow-card motion-safe:transition-shadow"
						>
							<SubmitStateIcon>
								<Search class="shrink-0" size={20} />
							</SubmitStateIcon>
							ค้นหา
						</button>
					</form>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	{activities.length > 0 && (
		<section aria-labelledby="home-activities" class="py-8 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
			<div class="page-container flex flex-col gap-7">
				<SectionHeading
					id="home-activities"
					label="ภาพกิจกรรม"
					title={ACTIVITIES_TITLE}
					href={ACTIVITIES_PATH}
				>
					<Heart slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
				</SectionHeading>
				<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
					{activities.map((activity, index) => (
						<li class:list={[index === 3 && "lg:hidden"]}>
							<ActivityCard activity={activity} headingLevel={3} compact />
						</li>
					))}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	{quickAccess.length > 0 && (
		<section aria-labelledby="home-quick-access" class="bg-surface-base py-8 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
			<div class="page-container flex flex-col gap-7">
				<SectionHeading id="home-quick-access" label="เข้าถึงข้อมูล" title="ข้อมูลและเอกสารสำคัญ">
					<FileText slot="icon" class="shrink-0" size={24} />
				</SectionHeading>
				<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-6 lg:grid-cols-4">
					{quickAccess.map((link) => (
						<li>
							<QuickLinkCard href={link.href} label={link.label} compact />
						</li>
					))}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	)}

	<section aria-labelledby="home-contact" class="bg-surface-soft py-8 sm:py-16">
		<div class="page-container grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[35rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-12">
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5">
				<h2 id="home-contact" class="text-h3 wrap-anywhere text-brand-dark lg:text-h2">
					<ThaiTitle text={identity.title} />
				</h2>
				<p class="text-body-large text-text-secondary-on-soft max-sm:hidden">{OFFICE_SUMMARY}</p>
				<OfficeContactDetails contact={contact} summary />
				<ArrowLink href="/contact">ดูข้อมูลติดต่อทั้งหมด</ArrowLink>
			</div>
			<div
				aria-hidden="true"
				class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-24 bg-linear-to-r from-contact-visual-from to-contact-visual-to px-6 text-center text-label text-brand-dark max-sm:hidden lg:h-57.5"
			>
				<span class="size-10.5 shrink-0 rounded-pill bg-surface-base"></span>
				แผนที่สำนักงานและพื้นที่อำเภอสอง
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script is:inline>
		for (const form of document.querySelectorAll("form[data-submit-state]")) {
			form.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
				if ("submitting" in form.dataset) event.preventDefault();
				else form.dataset.submitting = "";
			});
		}
		addEventListener("pageshow", () => {
			for (const form of document.querySelectorAll("form[data-submitting]")) {
				delete form.dataset.submitting;
			}
		});
	</script>
</SiteLayout>
